othing names an environment to check for a pin.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"probe\": \"subdatasets-resolvable\",\n      \"status\": \"not-checked\",\n      \"items\": [\n        \"stamped-checklist:must/002\",\n        \"stamped-checklist:may/001\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"No submodules or subdatasets: whether external inputs are linked at all needs a reading of the object.\",\n      \"evidence\": [],\n      \"details\": {\n        \"submodules\": []\n      },\n      \"item_status\": {\n        \"stamped-checklist:must/002\": \"not-checked\",\n        \"stamped-checklist:may/001\": \"not-checked\"\n      },\n      \"item_reason\": {\n        \"stamped-checklist:must/002\": \"No submodules or subdatasets: whether external inputs are linked at all needs a reading of the object.\",\n        \"stamped-checklist:may/001\": \"Inspect independently maintained project components; ordinary runtime/package dependencies are environment evidence. No components makes this item N/A.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"probe\": \"tree-clean\",\n      \"status\": \"unmet\",\n      \"items\": [\n        \"stamped-checklist:must/004\"\n      ],\n      \"reason\": \"4 path(s) are not committed, so the repository is not the whole state: ?? REPORT.md, ?? analyze.py, ?? atlas_cache/, ?? results/\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"uri\": \"git status --porcelain\",\n          \"description\": \"?? REPORT.md, ?? analyze.py, ?? atlas_cache/, ?? results/\",\n          \"sha256\": null\n        }\n      ],\n      \"details\": {\n        \"dirty\": [\n          \"?? REPORT.md\",\n          \"?? analyze.py\",\n          \"?? atlas_cache/\",\n          \"?? results/\"\n        ],\n        \"submodules_modified\": [],\n        \"tracked_text\": 4\n      },\n      \"item_status\": {\n        \"stamped-checklist:must/004\": \"unmet\"\n      },\n      \"item_reason\": {\n        \"stamped-checklist:must/004\": \"4 path(s) are not committed, so the repository is not the who